# API Standards

- Centralize API communication.
- Avoid direct fetch calls scattered across components.
- Use the existing API abstraction layer.

## Configuration

- Never hardcode production URLs.
- Use environment configuration properly.

## Error handling

Handle:
- loading
- empty responses
- validation errors
- unauthorized responses
- network failures
- server errors

## Async behavior

- Avoid race conditions where relevant.
- Cancel outdated requests when appropriate.
- Avoid duplicate unnecessary requests.